## Local Android SDK configuration template
# Copy this file to android/local.properties (ignored by Git), uncomment sdk.dir and set your SDK path.
# sdk.dir=/data/data/com.termux/files/home/android-sdk
#
# The Presage development key is NOT read from this file.
# The build reads it from ~/.config/smart-spectra-challenge/presage.properties (outside the repository).
# See the root README.
